# Optional on web/desktop; required for account access in native mobile apps.
# Leave empty for guest access on web/desktop. Native mobile stays at setup help.
# Obtain a publishable key from your Clerk application's API Keys page.
# Electron/iOS/Android: enable Native API and email-code sign-in/sign-up in Clerk.
# See docs/architecture/overview.md for supported flows and token storage.
# Never put a Clerk secret key in Vite client environment variables.
VITE_CLERK_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=
